========================================================================================
IS merged_walk HARMFUL AT LOW SHOTS? Its validation was at 8192.
========================================================================================
  Heisenberg N=4, 6 PAIRED seeds, 20 epochs, k=15, kappa=4.
  Both arms start each seed from identical parameters.
  merged_walk was validated at 8192 shots only: -0.0032 +- 0.0101, 0.3s.

     shots   merged=True  merged=False      diff   sigma   better
  ---------------------------------------------------------------
       256       -5.1498       -4.9816   -0.1682     0.7      4/6
      1024       -5.8300       -5.7565   -0.0735     1.7      4/6
      8192       -5.9224       -5.9760   +0.0535     1.5      2/6

  POSITIVE diff means merged_walk reached HIGHER energy, i.e. is worse.
  'better' counts seeds where merged won. A positive diff at 256 that
  vanishes by 8192 means the shipped default is wrong outside the regime
  it was validated in. Flat across budgets means merged_walk is not the
  cause of v53b's +0.739 and the stale-log question is still open.
  Read sigma against this project's record: under ~3 sigma on six seeds
  has reversed twice before.
